      ],
      "common:shortName": [],
      "common:generalComment": [
        {
          "#text": "Rock wool insulation provides thermal and sound insulation and can be used as a firestop between floors. It is made from natural, sustainable material and typically contains up to 75 percent recycled content. Rock wool is essentially basalt lava rock and chalk, heated to high temperatures and then spun into fine fibers. It is commonly used in hydroponics because it is pH neutral. Stone wool is a furnace product of molten rock at a temperature of about 1600 °C.",
          "@xml:lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "#text": "岩棉绝缘材料提供热量和声音的隔绝，并可以在楼层之间用作防火隔断。它由天然、可持续的材料制成，通常包含高达75%的再生内容。岩棉本质上是玄武岩熔岩和白垩，加热到高温然后纺成细纤维。它在水培中常用，因为它的pH值是中性的。石棉是熔岩在大约1600°C的温度下的炉产品。",
          "@xml:lang": "zh"
        }
      ],
